      "source": "Represents an HTTP cookie as a name-value pair consistent with the content of\nthe \"Cookie\" request header. The <a href=\"ResponseCookie.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.http\"><code>ResponseCookie</code></a> subclass has the\nadditional attributes expected in the \"Set-Cookie\" response header.",
      "translation": "表示为与\"Cookie\"请求头内容一致的名称 - 值对的 HTTP Cookie。<a href=\"ResponseCookie.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.http\"><code>ResponseCookie</code></a>子类具有\"Set-Cookie\"响应头中预期的附加属性。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the cookie value or an empty string (never <code>null</code>).",
